1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,680
Every character that you play as an artist, I think that you lend yourself to the craft.

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:09,320
There are definitely things that I have lent of myself to creating the character.

3
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:12,460
But I'm not non-binary in life.

4
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:13,220
I am gay.

5
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:22,060
I also felt that I had the right as a gay man to be able to play and portray a member of my community that was a part of the LGBTQ+.

6
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:25,960
If I did not, by that line of logic, I would never be able to play King Lear.

7
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:28,920
And then I said, oh, actually I would because my father was a prince.

8
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:30,240
So I have a royal line.

9
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:31,680
Welcome to the winter of our discontent.

10
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:32,860
Do you understand what I'm saying?

11
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:37,420
And I think that you have to be able to know yourself and as an artist, explore.

12
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:38,920
So I went shopping.

